      "created_at": "2025-06-25T07:29:20.712Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/8/6/869e1947cd3527cf692a157a6a04f83038c8f862.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/jcSHM4oM90YvK4Lh7rnRrQFAiEW.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/8/6/869e1947cd3527cf692a157a6a04f83038c8f862.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"jcSHM4oM90YvK4Lh7rnRrQFAiEW\" width=\"690\" height=\"419\" data-dominant-color=\"F4F0F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">912×554 7.78 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nIf I miss quiz 1, then will I be eligible to attend End term or not?<br>\n<a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/atulps\">@AtulPS</a>  <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sayan\">@sayan</a></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
