      "created_at": "2025-06-25T09:39:44.753Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/23f2004211\">@23f2004211</a></p>\n<p>As per mentioned in the grading document, the following is the only mentioned criteria for attending end term -</p>\n<p><code>average of the best 5 out of the first 7 weekly assessments (objective and programming) scores &gt;= 40/100</code></p>\n<p>So, yes, you will be able to end term if you miss quiz 1.</p>\n<p>Thanks &amp; Regards,<br>\nSwati Jain</p>",
